  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amnesty-Human Rights Education For All</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1- To provide the society right information on HR issues on the bases of HRE. To guide people in understanding the importance and affect of human rights and related concept in their/our life. 
2- To increase the awareness of the society about what Human Rights really mean and importance of human rights In their daily life. 
AND
Support people of Turkey to use their right to freedom of expression and talk more, advocate more on human rights issues</narrative>
  </description>
